## Interface: 16001
## Title: WU - Warrior Utilities
## Notes: Rage bar with marks and styles, set up and moved in Edit Mode, a range display showing the distance to your target, a Battle Shout timer on the player frame, a Sunder Armor and Demoralizing Shout tracker, audio alerts, a cooldown bar for each stance, a custom cooldown bar for any spell or item, trinket and usable gear bars with swapping, combat text and a minimap icon to open the options.
